Polish modification (tvOS Launcher PL)
------------------------------------
This is a modified version of tvOS Launcher by techgenius / techgenius1:
https://github.com/techgenius1/tvOS-Launcher

The PL modification adds Polish translations (including setup and weather),
redesigned Liquid Glass home tiles and detail windows, LiveScore integration,
goal overlays, local ADB permission setup, nighttime internet wallpapers,
wallpaper favorites, a matching screensaver, and adaptive glass clock placement
with on-device vehicle detection. The recommended setup mode keeps USB debugging
enabled. Changes are applied by pl/naloz.py and the classes in pl/java/.

